  "findings": [
    "The actual typed six-parameter system owns one canonical control map, queries actual WindowLight values, reads actual TimeOfDay/GameTime/ActiveSession and all unread payload-u32 LightWindowCmd. Existing cycle_t, global RNG, unit event, raw12B component TypeId and sin-based numeric-cast helper are actual erroneous consumers to replace.",
    "Original frame-seeded retarget enumerates all existing map values BEFORE insertion/removal; d5da9 advances ordinal before target comparison, d5db9 zero-extends frame u32 and d5dbd adds ordinal in64bits. Changed entries use local fastrand1.8 Rng with that seed and double its f32; skipped values still consume ordinal but no random draw.",
    "Explicit inserted state writes brightness=0,timer=0,actual=target=current flag. Last unread event alone compares actual decorator_id and sets brightness=1,target=1; does not change timer/actual. Shared keys intentionally alias one map value.",
    "Retain is actual Vec.contains over queried keys before timer/brightness updates. Initial timer>0 alone decrements; MAXSS second-zero semantics and transition only when resulting timer==0 are required. Initial zero/negative/NaN does not apply target. Actual nonzero byte chooses targetbrightness1, zero chooses0.",
    "The complete81B helper negates delta by sign XOR then multiplies rate, calls real expf import thunk, and evaluates (b-a)*(1-exp)+a through separate f32 steps. No implicit u32 numeric conversion, sin, timer-bit source or0.05rate remains. Cross-platform exp lastbit parity is unverified.",
    "Actual glass query/control lookup permits absent key brightness0 as original, optional Albedo/SemiTransparent remain optional; present asset lookup must resolve actual descriptor or retain real failure. Use same canonical InstanceKey/GpuWorld subset and existing build_window_glass packing; do not add row Vec/parallel map.",
    "Full unload9451B contains actual RandomState default initialization, write tick, old map deallocation, default map/state copy and lights_on=false at c63..cb5. Replacing the canonical resource with Default is the isolated same-owner fragment; map.clear retainingcapacity or clearing unrelated events would diverge.",
    "Typed OnExit<AppLoadingState> registration with DL1 and parameter tuple actual canonical control supports isolated OnExit(Game) fragment. Per-frame raw36 is independent of outer25; preserve existing ordinary numeric set edges and maintain→ApplyDeferred→unordered updates→flush44. No event/Changed/state gate or invented sibling chain."
  ],
