    "One canonical core/resources/window_lights module and one module declaration; component{checkedusize key,decorator_id}, LightInfo values, std RandomState map and globalflag. Old system-decorator names may only reexport this same TypeId. No mirror/cyclefield/secondmap.",
    "Canonical LightWindowCmd payload-u32 migration and actual App event lifecycle; single real per-frame window system Update36 plus isolated resource-default reset OnExit(Game), without installing old aggregate plugin or claiming9451B recovered.",
    "Real builder inserts the same canonical component using actual existing window_light input and decoratorID. Nani mapped-input admission/updater must check actual required components and route same owner through current maintain/barrier/update/flush44. Existing numeric packing function stays unchanged unless separately evidence-reviewed.",
    "One shared utils::time_continuous_lerp helper appended to exact currentfeaa base; root is sole current writer.04 projective must rebase only after this candidate is accepted, with old3helpers/7tests source bytes preserved. Exact final changed-source count and ownership references belong in implementationmanifest; this review does not assume six files when module/event/App seams require more."
